src/mlx2/adapters/tensor_fa_research.py contains a Metal kernel body
(TENSOR_FA_SOURCE) adapted from ggml's tensor-API flash attention kernel:

  repository: https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp
  pull request: 29570 (open, unmerged when read on 2026-10-01)
  revision: 7f0d4d5e0ae391e4ff75512402cb5dd141507244
