Adapted parts: the Q/C/NSG tiling, the tensor_ops matmul2d QK^T and P*V
descriptors, half-rounded scaled queries, half probabilities with the fp32
row sum taken over the same rounded values, the lazy running-max rescale
(only on growth > 8) with a per-row scale and a threadgroup "last rescale"
flag, and the clipped cooperative-tensor store. mlx2 modifications: MLX
mx.fast.metal_kernel wrapping, B1 [1, H, L, D] contiguous layout, in-kernel
causal masking from an explicit absolute query start (finite -FLT_MAX), a
causal KV loop bound, fp32 output, and a race-free atomic threadgroup
engagement counter. Masks, sinks, ALiBi and softcap paths were removed.
